  "headline": "Police Arrest Kampung Ambon Drug Supplier, Seizing Marijuana Cache",
  "seoTitle": "Police Raid Kampung Ambon Jakarta Drug Operation",
  "metaDescription": "Police have apprehended a major drug supplier linked to Kampung Ambon, seizing 64 kilograms of marijuana concealed within shipments of fruit and fish.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Authorities arrested a suspect identified as RA in Mandailing Natal, North Sumatra, following an investigation into Kampung Ambon drug distribution.",
    "The suspect allegedly recruited local farmers to cultivate marijuana which was then smuggled into Jakarta.",
    "Police seized 64 kilograms of marijuana valued at 2.5 billion rupiah, which had been hidden inside packages of durian and salted fish."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following ongoing efforts to curb drug trafficking in the Kampung Ambon area of West Jakarta, police have apprehended a primary supplier. The suspect, identified by initials RA, was located in the Mandailing Natal regency of North Sumatra. According to police reports, the individual operated by recruiting local agricultural workers to grow marijuana, which was subsequently transported to the capital. To evade detection, the illicit cargo—estimated to be worth 2.5 billion rupiah—was disguised using food products, specifically durian and salted fish. This arrest represents a significant development in local law enforcement investigations into the regional distribution networks supplying narcotics to Kampung Ambon. Officials continue to process the evidence gathered during this operation as they seek to dismantle the supply chain that has long targeted the area.",
